          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "When something approaches it, it fires off fragments of its steel shell in attack. This is not a conscious action but a conditioned reflex.",
